title: "The four-affine case of the Boolean hypercube Nullstellensatz"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "For up to four nonzero real affine forms whose zero sets cover the Boolean cube without a common zero, constructs a partition-of-unity certificate with degree at most min(n,80) for the reduced products. Together with the known five-form examples, this determines the exact threshold for unbounded degree."
